                      (    forth6809.asm):01389                                   ; OUTBUF - same fix and reasoning as TSTCR's
                      (    forth6809.asm):01390                                   ; own fix. EMITCH only reflects the LAST of
                      (    forth6809.asm):01391                                   ; the two characters TYPE emits ('B') by the
