                      (    forth6809.asm):02973         ; xt's slot effectively replaced by the throw code). Per CATCH's
                      (    forth6809.asm):02974         ; own spec, the i*x arguments' VALUES are explicitly unspecified
                      (    forth6809.asm):02975         ; after a catch, not just untested here - the final, unconditional
                      (    forth6809.asm):02976         ; stack restore discards them without needing to know how many
                      (    forth6809.asm):02977         ; there are.
