                      (    forth6809.asm):07025         ; exercising the crossing-boundary exit condition rather than
                      (    forth6809.asm):07026         ; landing-exactly-on-it, since those are handled by genuinely
                      (    forth6809.asm):07027         ; different checks in DOPLUSTEST (confirmed by reading its own
                      (    forth6809.asm):07028         ; code - crosses-sign OR lands-exactly, checked separately).
