                      (    forth6809.asm):07418         ; like the rest of this section - a plain runtime word, tested
                      (    forth6809.asm):07419         ; directly without the compile harness, same pattern as ALIGN's
                      (    forth6809.asm):07420         ; own test in section 3.6: pushes decoy values, calls UNLOOP,
