                      (    forth6809.asm):07630         ; TSTTHENZ - unit test for THEN, tag-mismatch case. Pushes a
                      (    forth6809.asm):07631         ; wrong value (0, matching none of TAGFWD/TAGBACK/TAGDO/TAGOF)
                      (    forth6809.asm):07632         ; in place of the expected TAGFWD, then calls THEN via CATCH.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07633         ; CFERR (confirmed by reading it directly) throws -22
                      (    forth6809.asm):07634         ; immediately without ever touching CODEHERE - the error path
                      (    forth6809.asm):07635         ; never reaches any compiling code - so this needs no CODEHERE
                      (    forth6809.asm):07636         ; redirect, unlike every other test in this section. Same
                      (    forth6809.asm):07637         ; CATCH-based pattern as the divide-by-zero tests in earlier
                      (    forth6809.asm):07638         ; sections: verify the thrown code and CATCH's own depth-
                      (    forth6809.asm):07639         ; restoration contract, not the unspecified i*x values.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07640         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
