                      (    forth6809.asm):08711         ; TSTVALTO - unit test for VALUE and TO together. Compiles
                      (    forth6809.asm):08712         ; "42 VALUE TESTWD", executes it (expect 42), then interprets
                      (    forth6809.asm):08713         ; "99 TO TESTWD" directly (TO parses "TESTWD" via WORD+FIND,
                      (    forth6809.asm):08714         ; needing LATEST still pointed at it - not restored until this
                      (    forth6809.asm):08715         ; whole test finishes, unlike every earlier test in this
                      (    forth6809.asm):08716         ; section), executes TESTWD again (expect 99). Explicitly forces
                      (    forth6809.asm):08717         ; STATE=0 (interpreting) before calling TO, since its own
                      (    forth6809.asm):08718         ; behavior genuinely differs by STATE (confirmed by reading its
                      (    forth6809.asm):08719         ; code: TOIMMED's direct store path only runs when STATE=0) -
                      (    forth6809.asm):08720         ; not left to chance.
                      (    forth6809.asm):08721         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
