                      (    forth6809.asm):10357         ; an immediate word, its own "compilation semantics" IS
                      (    forth6809.asm):10358         ; "execute it now" (that's what immediate means), so POSTPONE
                      (    forth6809.asm):10359         ; compiles a direct call to it - simpler to verify than the
                      (    forth6809.asm):10360         ; normal-word case, no second level involved.
                      (    forth6809.asm):10361         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
