                      (    forth6809.asm):15151         ; verifies both that DUP's own effect genuinely happened (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):15152         ; value really was duplicated) and that CATCH itself returns 0.
                      (    forth6809.asm):15153         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
