F559 DD08             (    forth6809.asm):20204                  STD   CODEHERE   ; where WORD is about to write its parsed
                      (    forth6809.asm):20205                                   ; text. Without this, the compiled path
                      (    forth6809.asm):20206                                   ; below would compile "JSR DOSTR" (3 bytes)
                      (    forth6809.asm):20207                                   ; directly at CODEHERE - the same address
                      (    forth6809.asm):20208                                   ; WORD just used - overwriting the first 2
                      (    forth6809.asm):20209                                   ; characters of the very text being staged,
                      (    forth6809.asm):20210                                   ; before the copy loop even runs. Reserving
                      (    forth6809.asm):20211                                   ; the gap first means the text lands exactly
